  "canonical_principle": "The longitudinal corpus preserves the distinction between the human research participant and author, AI-generated observations, computational processing, provenance infrastructure, publication infrastructure, and business operations. No external AI system is treated as the owner, author, or independent authority of the research merely because its generated output appears within the corpus."
